  "data": {
    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "For an EMPEROR’S CHILDREN Army Faction, a unit with Thrill Seekers can still charge and shoot in the same turn that it Advances or Falls Back. If it does so, leave out enemies that were in its Engagement Range when the turn began. Its shooting and charges also have to avoid targets chosen for an attack or charge by another unit in that same phase.",
